<title>SPAIN: Spain June CPI unchanged vs May, up 1.6 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Spain June CPI unchanged vs May, up 1.6 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute (INE) gave the following figures:</p>
<p> SPANISH INFLATION		JUNE 97    MAY 97   JUNE 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change	0.0	 0.1	-0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year rise		 1.6	 1.5	 3.6</p>
<p> Core inflation		    0.2	 0.1	 0.2</p>
<p> Year-on-year rise		 1.9	 1.9	 3.6</p>
<p> INDEX BY COMPONENTS	     JUNE 97     MAY 97     YR/YR</p>
<p> Food				  -0.4	  0.1	   -0.4</p>
<p> Clothing			     0.0	  0.2	    2.0</p>
<p> Housing				0.3	  0.2	    3.3</p>
<p> Household goods		    0.1	  0.1	    1.6</p>
<p> Medicine			     0.1	  0.5	    3.0</p>
<p> Transport			    0.0	  0.1	    2.0</p>
<p> Culture				0.0	  0.0	    2.0</p>
<p> Other				  0.3	  0.3	    2.9</p>
<p>Note - In food, fresh food fell 1.1 pct from the previous month (fell 0.9 pct year-on-year) and processed food rose 0.1 (down 0.2 pct year-on-year).</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
